"""
andy — a read-only TUI that shows where developer tooling hides your disk.

Containers and VM images, package manager caches, toolchains, build caches,
Xcode junk, model weights and per-project artifacts, measured and ranked.

Nothing is ever deleted, moved or modified. For each item andy shows the
command that would reclaim it, and can copy that command to your clipboard --
running it is your call.
"""

